    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Opsmaru home"><img src="/images/opsmaru-logo.svg" width="34" height="34" alt="" /><span>opsmaru.</span></a>
    <span class="eyebrow">404 / NO COMPUTE AT THESE COORDINATES</span>
    <h1>This page is<br /><span class="gradient-text">off the grid.</span></h1>
    <p>The page you’re looking for doesn’t exist. Head back to the platform to find your way.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">Back to Opsmaru <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
  </main>
</Layout>
